---
/**
 * @file src/components/WhatIBring.astro
 * @description Small section highlighting core behaviors and value proposition.
 */
---

<section class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-12">
    <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
            What I bring
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- Item 1: Embedded -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors duration-75 group">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors duration-75">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Embedded Systems</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Designing resource-constrained, real-time hardware applications with C/C++.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2: Systems thinking -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors duration-75 group">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors duration-75">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Systems thinking</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Connecting the dots between architecture, code, and user experience.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3: Product-minded -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors duration-75 group">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors duration-75">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Product-minded implementation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Prioritizing user needs and business goals in technical decisions.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4: Security & quality -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors duration-75 group">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors duration-75">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Attention to security & quality</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Writing robust, tested code with security best practices in mind.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
